{"key":"AccountActivityWindow","text":"## AccountActivityWindow\n\nThe **Account Activity Window** shows recent activity across one or more NOS\naccounts, read from GitHub-backed storage. Pick which accounts to include,\nswitch between activity tabs, and refresh on demand.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nAccount Chips | 0.30, 0.08 | Toggle which accounts to include. Your current account is highlighted. At least one account must be selected.\nTabs | 0.30, 0.15 | Switch between activity views.\nRefresh | 0.88, 0.08 | Re-fetch all selected accounts, bypassing the cache.\nContent | 0.50, 0.56 | The activity list for the selected accounts and tab.\nStatus | 0.50, 0.94 | Progress and messages (e.g. \"Refreshing…\").\n\n---\n\n### Selecting accounts\n\n- Click a **chip** to include / exclude that account (your own account is marked)\n- At least one account must stay selected\n- **Refresh** re-fetches everything fresh, ignoring the cache\n\n### Shortcuts\n\n- Button-driven; no special keys.\n\n### Status: Stable\n### Purpose: OS\n\n---","screenshot":""}